#### Phase 1: Infrastructure (Day 1)
1.  Create Supabase Project (`gitprofile-prod`).
2.  Create Clerk Application (`gitprofile-auth`).
3.  Create Upstash Redis Database.
4.  Set Environment Variables in Vercel & `.env.local`.

#### Phase 2: Database & Auth (Day 2)
5.  Run SQL Migration (Create tables defined in Section 4).
6.  Install `@clerk/nextjs` `@supabase/supabase-js`.
7.  Delete `app/api/auth`.
8.  Implement `middleware.ts` for route protection.
9.  Implement `api/webhooks/clerk` to sync users.

#### Phase 3: The Engine (Day 3-4)
10. Remove `repositoryCache.js`. Setup `lib/redis.ts`.
11. Build `supabase/functions/worker-scan`.
12. Rewrite `app/api/analysis/route.js` to enqueue tasks.
13. Update UI to Poll for results.

#### Phase 4: Optimization (Day 5)
14. Implement ETag caching in Member Worker.
15. Implement "User Token" usage for Pro members.

#### Phase 5: Launch
16. Run Integration Tests.
17. Deploy to Vercel.

